<title>INDIA: India's RBI buys $2.33 bln from market in March.</title>
<headline>India's RBI buys $2.33 bln from market in March.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's central bank bought $2.329 billion in March 1997, the Reserve Bank of India (RBI) June bulletin said.</p>
<p>The purchase was valued at 83.54 billion rupees, RBI said.</p>
<p>RBI's cumulative dollar purchases since March 1995 amounted to $7.8 billion, the bulletin said.</p>
<p>RBI's dollar purchases in April 1997 amounted to $641 million, valued at 22.97 billion rupees, the RBI bulletin said.</p>
